00:18:03.840 --> 00:18:05.840
Here’s a reference…

00:18:06.000 --> 00:18:09.039
we have the Mixed Nuts translation team

00:18:09.840 --> 00:18:12.559
and we’re translating an old Law text;

00:18:13.840 --> 00:18:16.440
the vows of the monks,
The vows of the bhikkhuni.

00:18:17.120 --> 00:18:25.140
They are talking about vows,
traditions that we shouldn't...

00:18:25.340 --> 00:18:29.820
When you become a monk or a nun,
they give you robes, they give you

00:18:29.840 --> 00:18:31.840
a small Buddha statue,

00:18:32.960 --> 00:18:34.960
and they give you a water filter.

00:18:35.919 --> 00:18:39.279
And in ancient India, you had to carry
this water filter with you.

00:18:40.080 --> 00:18:43.360
When you drink water from a stream,

00:18:44.000 --> 00:18:49.439
